# "When Marina Vendrell's Grimoire enters, if you cast it": Show and Tell puts it onto the battlefield from Bot1's hand without
# casting it (CR 603.4), so its enters trigger finds no cast and Bot1 draws nothing: its library is as it was and its hand
# is just the cards it did not play. (Casting it, in the sibling scenario, draws five: the positive control.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Show and Tell
Marina Vendrell's Grimoire
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Marina Vendrell's Grimoire)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Marina Vendrell's Grimoire.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
Stack.Count = 0
